########## hidden.py ##########

1. Support found, ranked

  [1] Furey (2016), arXiv:1611.09182, ch. 2  [cited in SOTP, Zenodo 22962557, as [3]]
      supports: the conceptual core of the whole 'Causal' trilogy: that causality and irreversible time arise from the structure of an algebraic expression
        "Taking multiplication to be the propagation along an edge, and addition to be the joining of two edges at a vertex, it can be seen that this unevaluated algebraic expression gives a causal set."
        "In the case of an algebra, an event is a calculation. ... an event can be seen to be irreversible, it cannot 'unhappen'. ... Time, then, is simply a sequence of calculations, and is clearly irreversible."
        "the octonions' non-associativity is not a impediment, but instead a gift, and that this misunderstood algebra is really at the heart of the standard model of particle physics."
      rider: Furey's own next step is the rider. Her gauge apparatus lives in an ASSOCIATIVE algebra -- 'As the composition of maps is always associative, C(x)O-left is an associative algebra', faithfully representing Cl(6) -- and her causal-set claim is conjectured only for associative expressions: 'It is at this early stage only a conjecture that any (associative) algebraic expression gives a causal set.' So the motive is supported and the mechanism, the associator as a hardware observable, is not.
      -> supports the motive, refutes the mechanism, from the same thesis

  [2] Baez (2002), arXiv:math/0105155, sec. 2.3 and 3.3  [cited in openQL v1.0, Zenodo 23112560, as [5]]
      supports: a real-matrix encoding of octonion multiplication, and a derivation of the number 12 better than either of the two the preprint gives
        "Left multiplication by any element a in K gives an operator L_a : K -> K, x -> ax. ... its matrix is block diagonal, built from 2 x 2 blocks ... We thus obtain a representation of the Clifford algebra Cliff(Im(K)) on K."
        "we define sl(m, K) to be the Lie algebra of operators on K^m generated by operators of this form. ... Note that multiplication in this group is given by composition of real-linear operators, which is associative even for K = O."
        "Note that the numbers 9, 10, 12 and 16 are 8 more than the dimensions of R, C, H and O. As usual, this is no coincidence!"
      rider: The weak form of the claim is supported and the strong form is excluded: L_a o L_b != L_{ab}, so this is a representation of operators, not an isomorphism of algebras. The openql-eval repository already measures exactly this construction -- L_x L_y against L_{xy} gives 1.8e-15 for H and 29.5 (relative 2.76) for O -- but did not credit Baez with supplying it. For 12: sl(3,H) acts on H^3 ~ R^12 as real 12x12 operators and the magic square carries so(12) at (H,H). The preprint never points at this.
      -> genuine support the preprint does not claim, and a better derivation than its own

  [3] Adler (1995), via his own summary arXiv:hep-th/9607008, with Horwitz arXiv:quant-ph/9602001 and Baez & Huerta arXiv:1101.5690  [cited in PCTP, Zenodo 22962188, as [1]]
      supports: the premise that the ordinary tensor product fails over the quaternions -- a genuine, long-standing obstruction, and Adler is the right citation for it
        "The construction of a tensor product of quaternion modules ... has long been an obstacle in quaternionic theories, since there is an essential destruction of linearity, i.e., f q (x) g != (f (x) g)q, where q in H."
        "the tensor product of quaternionic Hilbert spaces is not naturally a quaternionic Hilbert space."
      rider: Adler's key result is fatal to the application: 'the S-matrix is always a complex matrix with no dependence on the quaternionic units j, k ... Hence the asymptotic dynamics for quaternionic quantum mechanics is always an effective complex theory', and 'noncommutative dynamics hides itself beneath effective complex quantum mechanical structures'. A processor whose output is measured cannot exhibit the non-commutativity it is built to execute.
      -> supports the premise, refutes the device, from the same book

  [4] Bi et al. (2011), DOI 10.1038/nphoton.2011.270  [cited in PCTP, Zenodo 22962188, as [4]]
      supports: on-chip non-reciprocity, which is the element the preprint needs in order to forbid back-propagation and enforce a causal ordering
        "we report the first monolithically integrated magneto-optical isolator on silicon. Using a non-reciprocal optical resonator ... we demonstrate unidirectional optical transmission with an isolation ratio up to 19.5 dB"
      rider: Non-reciprocity is S != S-transpose, not AB != BA. It does not produce non-commuting operators: Jones matrices are already non-commutative in the reciprocal case. And the numbers do not match -- the preprint claims better than 35 dB of reverse isolation against this source's 19.5 dB.
      -> real hardware support for one element, not for the logic

  [5] Lehmann et al. (2011), DOI 10.1016/j.soilbio.2011.04.022, abstract  [cited in Phytomining, Zenodo 23174932, as 3]
      supports: biochar as a carrier for a bacterial inoculant, which is the smart-pellet concept
        "a significant number of early studies on biochar-type materials as soil amendments either for managing pathogens, as inoculant carriers or for manipulative experiments"
      rider: The same review contradicts the 'massive CEC' the preprint claims -- 'typically have initially low cation exchange capacities (CEC)' -- and reports nitrogen immobilisation 'with resultant decreases in N uptake and growth of crops' and loss of mycorrhizal fungi where heavy-metal content is high.
      -> real precedent for the delivery vehicle, not for its cargo

  [6] Tesla (1894), US 512,340  [cited in COBAR, Zenodo 22923154, as [1]]
      supports: the preprint's sentence on distributed capacitance in a bifilar winding, which is the patent's own teaching
        "Capacity secured in this particular way possesses an additional advantage in that it is evenly distributed, a consideration of the greatest importance in many cases."
      rider: Two corrections against this audit's own prior assumption. The patent does NOT presuppose an iron core; it is explicitly agnostic ('any conductor'), so it can be cited neither for nor against coreless operation. And Tesla's aim is to cancel self-inductance so the coil behaves 'as though it possessed no self-induction', not to build a high-Q tank for force generation. Acoustic transduction: no mention in the patent.
      -> supported, plus a correction to this audit rather than to the preprint

2. The pattern in the three strongest findings

  Furey, Dixon and Baez all resolve the non-associativity problem the
  same way, by moving to the associative algebra of left-multiplication
  operators:

    Furey:  "As the composition of maps is always associative,
             C(x)O-left is an associative algebra"
    Dixon:  "O_L ~ R(8) ~ CL(0,6) ... (Note: O_L is trivially
             associative.)"
    Baez:   "multiplication in this group is given by composition of
             real-linear operators, which is associative even for
             K = O"

  That manoeuvre is exactly the one the architecture is premised on not
  making.  So the hidden defence exists for the motivation of these
  papers and is refuted for their mechanism, out of the same pages.

3. Claims with no carrier anywhere in the 69 references

  - the associator executed as a hardware observable
      SOTP, PCTP; Furey, Dixon and Baez all pass to an associative algebra of left-multiplication operators instead
  - 2-bit or ternary tensor-core arithmetic
      X-Ternary; the Hopper whitepaper lists FP8, FP16, BF16, TF32, FP64 and INT8, and no generation has a sub-INT4 MMA type
  - pure spin currents with zero ohmic dissipation
      SOTP; Manchon et al. derive the spin current from an applied charge current, at 1e7-1e8 A/cm^2 and about 100 fJ per bit
  - non-destructive readout of an NV centre without state collapse
      PCTP; Doherty et al.: the optical readout 'simultaneously spin-polarise[s] the centre into the m_s = 0 spin projection'
  - the elimination of hallucinations by determinism
      X-Ternary; InstructGPT reports 41% to 21%, and its 1.3B PPO-ptx model does worse than GPT-3 of the same size
  - net momentum on a closed system
      Momentum Drive; the magnon BEC forms in both +/-k_min minima with zero group velocity, and the one reference with real forces is a squeeze-film reaction against a plate tens of micrometres away
  - accelerated DNA transcription and repair from magnetic isotopes
      Phytomining; Buchachenko measures 3-5x SUPPRESSION of DNA synthesis for the same three isotopes and proposes them to kill cells
  - biogenic gold as a scavenger of reactive oxygen species
      Phytomining; Reith et al.: gold INDUCES oxidative stress, and the cell exports it
  - a structural relationship between ceruloplasmin and hemocyanin
      Hemocyanin; Hellman & Gitlin: ceruloplasmin 'plays no essential role in the transport or metabolism of' copper, and the domain intersection is empty
  - a symplectic update step
      Intensional Physics Computing; 'symplectic' occurs in one work in the whole corpus, Baez, about the Freudenthal space for E7
  - 112 as a dimension
      openQL; '112' does not occur in Baez or Kuipers. The only '112' in the six works is Markidis's '112.7 Tflops/s theoretical peak' -- a throughput
  - coreless acoustic transduction efficiency
      COBAR; the cited Beranek & Mellow contains the relation by which a coreless design loses four to six decades of efficiency
  - conductive nanofibres co-spun into a membrane
      COBAR; the Jirsak patent is about spinning throughput, spins aqueous PVA, and lists no acoustic application

4. Scoring the claim that was tested

  support found and substantial          6 places
  claims with no carrier in any reference 13

  The claim is partly vindicated.  In openQL and SOTP the cited
  literature does carry support the preprints never spell out, and in
  one case a better derivation than the preprint's own.  That is the
  author's point and it stands.  It does not extend to the 46
  references attached to nothing, to the 3 deposits with no references,
  or to the claims above, which the cited works contradict in their own
  words.

